			"notes": "First stable release.\n\n- fair value from sold comparables, matched by tier + recomb state (as-is market first)\n- BIN walls fetched per-tier, normalized per-build; anchor, cap, and offer ceiling\n- every modifier priced: enchants, stars/essence, HPB, reforges, gems, scrolls, pet held items\n- trade-window pitch calculator with real tiered AH fees\n- in-screen draggable panels, ModMenu config screen, price-refresh keybind, loading spinners\n- polite Coflnet usage: bazaar-only parts never hit the AH endpoint, global 429 backoff\n\nRequires Fabric Loader ≥0.19, Fabric API, Fabric Language Kotlin on Minecraft 26.1.2."
